    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51140" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīsŭālis</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		visus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>attained by sight</i> (late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">probatio,</span>”
